  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2wMZKZ7B6E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/735938861636780042?style=flat-square&logo=discord&label=Discord&color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcozary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-Ko--fi-F16061?style=flat-square&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a> • <a href=\"https://github.com/Cozary/Floral-Enchantment/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Cozary/Floral-Enchantment?style=flat-square&logo=github&logoColor=white&color=364763\" alt=\"Issues\"></a> • <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252ffloral-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/floral-enchantment/localized.svg\" alt=\"Crowdin\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Tmf7NUj.png\" alt=\"\"> 關於</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>正在尋找簡單的裝飾模組嗎？此模組新增了花叢，你可以從中獲得各種花朵的藤蔓。</p>\n<p>就像長滿青苔的石頭一樣，你也可以從每種花朵中獲得長滿青苔的石頭來進行裝飾！還有長滿青苔的石磚。</p>\n<p>它還包含了用來放置花朵的花盆和大花盆。以及花卉籃子和花環。</p>\n<p>花藤可以從花叢中獲得。</p>\n<p>若已安裝「Obfuscation」模組，由於相容性問題，攜帶大花盆時的特殊渲染效果將被停用。</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Tmf7NUj.png\" alt=\"\"></strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>想看看實際樣貌嗎？</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><strong>花叢與藤蔓</strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MzWfZwF.png\" width=\"409\" height=\"230\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KRtq5Qd.png\" width=\"409\" height=\"230\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>長滿青苔的石頭與&nbsp;長滿青苔的石磚</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RHrzcHa.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HKI8VDr.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"213\"><br></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>大花盆與大型雙口花盆</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SbCoMN8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/II5BBiq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\"></strong></p><p><strong>攜帶大花盆的外觀有所不同！我們還有一位喜歡音樂的小夥伴...&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RrkqnYx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"214\" height=\"204\"></strong><strong><img src=\"https://media4.giphy.com/media/6ypZtIZMGmQEkG6CQB/giphy.gif?cid=790b7611747b4f4e8b57624ffc63ed3e382fcf35117761df&rid=giphy.gif&ct=g\" alt=\"\" width=\"281\" height=\"157\"></strong></p><p><strong>輕鬆獲得！</strong></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media3.giphy.com/media/sX0h681QZxzyLKUBME/giphy.gif?cid=790b76113122803de04dcf2a26c200eabdf26461ef6e3c9f&rid=giphy.gif&ct=g\" alt=\"\" width=\"254\" height=\"142\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>花卉籃子！！[新]</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6AqlL4I.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"573\" height=\"322\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zVLHb2A.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"159\" height=\"245\"><img src=\"blob:https://imgur.com/e39eaa72-2fd4-426f-9eec-675e8c1d5665\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>花環</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Dq3TB41.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></strong></p></div>",
